{"version":1,"content":"<p></p>\n<h2>日本爆紅煮飯神器「黑色米粒」</h2>\n<p>日本 Cogit 推出的「DELISTA 鉑金煮飯石」（ふっくら美味しいこめつぶちゃん），只需放入電飯煲一同煮飯，即可提升白飯的黏性、甜度與口感，成為近期日本話題廚房好物。</p>\n<h2>白飯口感大升級</h2>\n<p>這款煮飯石以矽膠橡膠製成，內含奈米鉑金粒子、遠紅外線粉末及炭素成分。 奈米鉑金粒子能令水質呈弱鹼性，分解米粒表面蛋白質，讓水分更充分滲透至米芯；炭素則發揮遠紅外線效果，使每粒米更加蓬鬆飽滿。 官方表示，使用後白飯甜度可提升約 2.4 倍，口感更 Q 彈有黏性。</p>\n<h2>放入電飯煲一齊煮即可</h2>\n<p>除提升味道外，煮飯石亦具備抗氧化功能，能有效延緩白飯在保溫過程中變黃或產生異味，令米飯更持久保持新鮮。 使用方法簡單，洗米加水後直接放入煮飯石即可一同烹煮，清洗後可重複使用約 200 次，亦可用洗碗機清洗，經濟實用。</p>\n<p> <figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179179929271250619_8090253826accaffd3cad7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179179929467318425_16418368556accafff3bd33.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179179929666510513_4664813596accb00197f5c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179179929952472556_10380906216accb0047eb51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeYwWWdE7TE/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%96%b0%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1-%e6%97%a5%e6%9c%ac-%e7%85%ae%e9%a3%af%e7%a5%9e%e5%99%a8-ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8-ww01-3522221/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本爆紅煮飯神器「黑色米粒」放入電飯煲一齊煮!白飯口感大升級</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期</a>.</p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T11:19:08.373637+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":531,"images":0,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"rss-http-error"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:37:47.104081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:17:37.008727+00:00","content_hash":"cfd21648d4cad5dcad54a317f9367bd51c4c829d2e7ca3f81ff1e567d1e388b7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 404","content_retention":null}